<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>For My Pretty Girl ❤️</title>

<style>
body {
    margin: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #ffc0cb, #ff69b4, #ff1493);
}

/* 💗 FLOATING HEARTS */
.heart {
    position: absolute;
    color: white;
    font-size: 18px;
    animation: floatUp 6s linear infinite;
    opacity: 0.7;
}

@keyframes floatUp {
    0% { transform: translateY(100vh) scale(0.5); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(1.5); }
}

/* 🐻 FLOATING BEARS */
.bear {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 22px;
    animation: floatBear 8s linear infinite;
    opacity: 0.8;
}

@keyframes floatBear {
    0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(0deg); }
    100% { transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(360deg); }
}

/* 💌 MAIN CARD */
.card {
    width: 360px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    position: relative;
    margin: auto;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
}

/* 💖 TEXT */
h1 {
    font-size: 2em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

p {
    font-size: 1.05em;
    line-height: 1.6em;
}

/* 💕 BUTTON */
button {
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: white;
    color: #ff1493;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
    background: #ff1493;
    color: white;
}

/* 💌 MESSAGE BOX */
#message {
    display: none;
    margin-top: 15px;
    text-align: left;
    max-height: 300px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding-right: 5px;
}

/* smooth scrollbar */
#message::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 5px;
}
#message::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

    <h1>For My Pretty Girl ❤️</h1>

    <p>
        I made this because sometimes my feelings are too big for words…
    </p>

    <button onclick="showMessage()">Open My Heart 💌</button>

    <div id="message">

        <p>
        My pretty girl… ❤️<br><br>

        I don’t even know where to start because every word still feels too small for what you mean to me. But I’ll try… because you deserve to hear it all.
        </p>

        <p>
        You are not just someone I love — you are someone who changed the way I see love itself. Before you, I thought love was just a feeling. But now I understand it’s a person… and for me, that person is you.
        </p>

        <p>
        My pretty girl, when I say I love you, I don’t just mean in the easy moments. I mean in the quiet nights, the overthinking moments, the days where things don’t feel perfect — I still choose you. Always you.
        </p>

        <p>
        You are the kind of person who makes ordinary moments feel special. Even silence with you feels peaceful. Even distance doesn’t change how close you are to my heart.
        </p>

        <p>
        If I ever make mistakes, if I ever fall short, I still hope you know this one truth: my feelings for you are real, deep, and not something that fades easily. You are engraved in my heart in a way I can’t undo.
        </p>

        <p>
        My pretty girl… I don’t just want you in my life for now. I want you in my future, in my growth, in my peace, in my happiness. I want you in every version of my life that comes next.
        </p>

        <p>
        And if love is about choosing someone again and again, then I choose you… every time, without hesitation.
        </p>

        <p>
        ❤️ Forever yours, my pretty girl.
        </p>

    </div>

</div>

<script>

/* 💌 SHOW MESSAGE */
function showMessage() {
    document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
}

/* 💗 FLOATING HEARTS */
function heart() {
    const h = document.createElement("div");
    h.classList.add("heart");
    h.innerHTML = "❤️";
    h.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
    h.style.animationDuration = (3 + Math.random() * 3) + "s";
    document.body.appendChild(h);
    setTimeout(() => h.remove(), 6000);
}

/* 🐻 FLOATING BEARS */
function bear() {
    const b = document.createElement("div");
    b.classList.add("bear");
    b.innerHTML = "🐻";
    b.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
    b.style.animationDuration = (5 + Math.random() * 3) + "s";
    document.body.appendChild(b);
    setTimeout(() => b.remove(), 8000);
}

setInterval(heart, 250);
setInterval(bear, 800);

</script>

</body>
</html>
